    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="LatticeGasAdsorption models M independent, non-interacting adsorption sites, each either empty or occupied with binding energy \epsilon. Treating the sites in equilibrium with an ideal-gas reservoir gives exactly the Langmuir isotherm \theta=P/(P+P_0) -- shown here for two binding strengths, alongside the purely combinatorial (fixed-`N`, canonical) configurational entropy of the lattice, which is maximal at half filling.">

